      "name": {
        "es": "Absorbe Electricidad",
        "en": "Volt Absorb"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Si le alcanza un movimiento de tipo Eléctrico, recupera PS en vez de sufrir daño.",
        "en": "Whenever an Electric-type move hits this Pokémon, it heals for 1/4 of its maximum HP, negating any other effect on it. This ability will not take effect if this Pokémon is Ground-type and thus immune to Electric moves. Electric moves will ignore this Pokémon's Substitute. This effect includes non-damaging moves, i.e. Thunder Wave."
      }
    },
